<html><head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"></head><body>Good morning everyone,<br><br>I wanted to let you know about some updates to our Paid Time Off policy that take effect August 1, 2026. The key changes are:<br><br>1. Accrual rates for employees with 3+ years of service increase from 6.15 hrs/pay period to 6.77 hrs/pay period (equivalent to 22 days/year, up from 20).<br><br>2. PTO carryover is now capped at 40 hours into the next calendar year. Any balance above 40 hours as of December 31 will be forfeited, so please plan accordingly.<br><br>3. PTO requests of 3+ consecutive days now require 2 weeks advance notice (previously 1 week).<br><br>The updated policy document is available on the shared drive under HR &gt; Policies &gt; PTO-Policy-v4.2.pdf. Please review it at your convenience.<br><br>If you have questions, my door is always open.<br><br>Joni Sherman<br>HR Manager<br>Waverly Industrial Solutions, Inc.</body></html>

